                        ],
                        "form": "oufissimes"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6579c600-610e-4020-a8c6-346d678d9a1c",
                        "entry_id": "82dd56bc-476e-39a4-8636-e4c64ef5ffea",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "ouffissime"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0de004b7-b79b-33f6-b9be-3051a80905df",
                        "entry_id": "82dd56bc-476e-39a4-8636-e4c64ef5ffea",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Extrêmement ouf ; complètement fou."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "104ebb8a-7c60-414e-a49f-0c06708594b3",
                                "sense_id": "0de004b7-b79b-33f6-b9be-3051a80905df",
                                "text": "Eh bien, cette mégarencontre de manipulateurs d’ADN, la semaine dernière à Boston, a dépassé tout ce que j'imaginais. « Oufissime », comme dirait notre Arthur. Croyez-moi, les biohackers californiens sont loin d'être les seuls à jouer au Lego avec le génome des micro-organismes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2e37239-7618-4d1e-abe4-2210ef06cfc1",
                                "sense_id": "0de004b7-b79b-33f6-b9be-3051a80905df",
                                "text": "La sobriété et la retenue n'ayant pas cours sur le Net, j'alternais entre le dieu vivant et le débile profond, le boss et le boloss, j'avais le swag, puis je ne l'avais plus, ma prestation était chanmé, oufissime ou trop abusée, ce qui voulait tout et rien dire à la fois."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f011839a-57db-4553-801d-7c9e31b49a08",
                                "sense_id": "0de004b7-b79b-33f6-b9be-3051a80905df",
                                "text": "— Ça marche. Alors, Anton, quoi de neuf ? Je veux tout savoir ! Ton dernier album est génial, au fait !\n— Oui, Lucita, l'album est oufissime. Tu as aimé la chanson où je chante avec une nana ?\n— Grave ! Et toi Heather, ton rôle de manager te plaît ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bac26772-e5ce-424d-9854-e872e233553c",
                                "sense_id": "0de004b7-b79b-33f6-b9be-3051a80905df",
                                "text": "Et puis, un jour, LE DIEU DE LA DÉCORATION PÂTISSIÈRE (non, je ne fais pas référence à Mercotte) m'a guidé vers la lumière et j'ai compris que ces gâteaux « oufissimes » étaient en fait recouverts de pâte à sucre, une matière encore peu connue et quasi-introuvable sur le terres de France, mais d'une banalité sans nom outre-Atlantique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b833d169-e069-45db-9e09-93f568c7692c",
                        "source_entry_id": "82dd56bc-476e-39a4-8636-e4c64ef5ffea",
                        "source_sense_id": "0de004b7-b79b-33f6-b9be-3051a80905df",
                        "target_lang_word": "crazy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "crazy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "622844be-65e9-34fc-b388-fdcf09fdd903",
                                        "entry_id": "bf20a803-1380-30db-9489-a5c12c585bf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of unsound mind; insane; demented."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca05b9b8-aa49-4909-a888-19ce3913b2e7",
                                                "sense_id": "622844be-65e9-34fc-b388-fdcf09fdd903",
                                                "text": "His ideas were both frightening and crazy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a10d9182-08ac-4db8-a9b3-06d230d3ad7c",
                                                "sense_id": "622844be-65e9-34fc-b388-fdcf09fdd903",
                                                "text": "Those words appearing to be merely the ravings of superannuation, they were not regarded; but when no other traces of Mary could be found, old Andrew went up to consult this crazy dame once more, but he was not able to bring any such thing to her recollection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89a62c80-00be-4289-b6b4-2a590a7cbdd4",
                                                "sense_id": "622844be-65e9-34fc-b388-fdcf09fdd903",
                                                "text": "Of all the queer collections of humans outside of a crazy asylum, it seemed to me this sanitarium was the cup winner. […] When you're well enough off so's you don't have to fret about anything but your heft or your diseases you begin to get queer, I suppose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "853c4f2c-6469-4d41-8fc9-8308e3fce97d",
                                                "sense_id": "622844be-65e9-34fc-b388-fdcf09fdd903",
                                                "text": "Now think of all the years you tried to\nFind someone to satisfy you\nI might be as crazy as you say\nIf I'm crazy then it's true\nThat it's all because of you\nAnd you wouldn't want me any other way"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9018c871-c5f7-4949-8e8f-375a11d0d228",
                                                "sense_id": "622844be-65e9-34fc-b388-fdcf09fdd903",
                                                "text": "Grab-a-cop-gun kinda crazy / She's poison but tasty / Yeah, people say \"Run, don't walk, away\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "daff3fe7-b75f-37f2-a4a7-f087a8eaa98f",
                                        "entry_id": "bf20a803-1380-30db-9489-a5c12c585bf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Out of control."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89169e9f-8948-4cb4-894d-bfebb3ff11de",
                                                "sense_id": "daff3fe7-b75f-37f2-a4a7-f087a8eaa98f",
                                                "text": "When she gets on the motorcycle she goes crazy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43244ef8-944b-3efb-ab52-c3876401adee",
                                        "entry_id": "bf20a803-1380-30db-9489-a5c12c585bf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very excited or enthusiastic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9492da89-7d44-48b2-82fa-d4a01480bb2c",
                                                "sense_id": "43244ef8-944b-3efb-ab52-c3876401adee",
                                                "text": "He went crazy when he won."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d94540b9-3873-4eb9-af01-2257988e5845",
                                                "sense_id": "43244ef8-944b-3efb-ab52-c3876401adee",
                                                "text": "The girls were crazy to be introduced to him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61f5d1a9-f42f-47af-9003-5c49e53404f9",
                                                "sense_id": "43244ef8-944b-3efb-ab52-c3876401adee",
                                                "text": "The craziest, most extraordinary banger race on the planet: 10,000+ miles from Prague to Siberia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00255f8d-d152-398a-a79b-5113958b05c7",
                                        "entry_id": "bf20a803-1380-30db-9489-a5c12c585bf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In love; experiencing romantic feelings."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df7485b2-763b-4457-9181-9e350fb60194",
                                                "sense_id": "00255f8d-d152-398a-a79b-5113958b05c7",
                                                "text": "Why is she so crazy about him?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bbee113e-e50b-3d90-8912-61e571402d33",
                                        "entry_id": "bf20a803-1380-30db-9489-a5c12c585bf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very unexpected; wildly surprising."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0d3819f-c9a6-4977-aa06-3a5d8e5bc265",
                                                "sense_id": "bbee113e-e50b-3d90-8912-61e571402d33",
                                                "text": "The game had a crazy ending."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2adffde6-1ce9-43e8-82b7-8b3015cf9007",
                                                "sense_id": "bbee113e-e50b-3d90-8912-61e571402d33",
                                                "text": "[…] at all, just a vast space of desert out in the saltlands of Nevada. It's serious dressing up, the maddest entertainment, craziest art, and at the end there's the burning of a huge effigy, stuffed with pyrotechnics 287."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c6d018f-3c9f-49ef-b86d-a83c88eefa33",
                                                "sense_id": "bbee113e-e50b-3d90-8912-61e571402d33",
                                                "text": "We'd like to think such a kooky idea has no shot at getting on the ballot, like the previous attempts by the two main Calexiters — Marcus Ruiz Evans and Louis J. Marinelli — to get some sort of secession proposal on the ballot. But crazier things have happened."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a52dffb-8b14-4316-b010-73135d7c29b6",
                                                "sense_id": "bbee113e-e50b-3d90-8912-61e571402d33",
                                                "text": "“It’s been a long process and I’ve come close to giving up along the way, but this is undoubtedly the craziest archaeological excavation I’ve yet been part of,” Bloch said in the news release."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d99746b-622e-3afb-a45d-8aed79511b3c",
                                        "entry_id": "bf20a803-1380-30db-9489-a5c12c585bf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Flawed or damaged; unsound, liable to break apart; ramshackle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7109fb0-0198-4cba-a40d-4026fca59515",
                                                "sense_id": "5d99746b-622e-3afb-a45d-8aed79511b3c",
                                                "text": "Buchanan shewed her into a room adjoining to Mr. Steele's dressing-room, and separated from it by a very crazy partition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bdb1ed5-ab97-4110-b5d2-57aa5ef9cd84",
                                                "sense_id": "5d99746b-622e-3afb-a45d-8aed79511b3c",
                                                "text": "Piles of mean and crazy houses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08859cde-bbda-4de1-8040-eb520c336ac0",
                                                "sense_id": "5d99746b-622e-3afb-a45d-8aed79511b3c",
                                                "text": "They […] got a crazy boat to carry them to the island."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1a3d621-98b2-45e3-a0cc-1322edf3e9a6",
                                                "sense_id": "5d99746b-622e-3afb-a45d-8aed79511b3c",
                                                "text": "Casement windows opened, crazy doors were unbarred, and people came forth shivering—chilled, as yet, by the new sweet air."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a60b271-a358-3a21-9b34-01b2e6633742",
                                        "entry_id": "bf20a803-1380-30db-9489-a5c12c585bf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sickly, frail; diseased."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "109171cf-fa8b-4eea-beb4-15b106245451",
                                                "sense_id": "7a60b271-a358-3a21-9b34-01b2e6633742",
                                                "text": "Over moist and crazy brains."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4f4ce22-d164-4785-be3f-b75bcd430c95",
                                                "sense_id": "7a60b271-a358-3a21-9b34-01b2e6633742",
                                                "text": "One of great riches, but a crazy constitution."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e96561ce-fcc3-49a2-80a5-3324f8778bd3",
                                                "sense_id": "7a60b271-a358-3a21-9b34-01b2e6633742",
                                                "text": "My poor aunt has often told me […] how long she herself was apprehensive lest my crazy frame, which is now of common shape, should remain for ever crooked and deformed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "crazy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2511157e-f1c2-3b57-9fce-e396be586903",
                                        "entry_id": "e909c471-78b8-3477-b1e5-e0cba5c50097",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very, extremely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6ca7b31-2cec-4fa9-bed8-7194bc33dad6",
                                                "sense_id": "2511157e-f1c2-3b57-9fce-e396be586903",
                                                "text": "That trick was crazy good."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a51f53ec-53d6-4a99-8d9f-95012f749f37",
                                                "sense_id": "2511157e-f1c2-3b57-9fce-e396be586903",
                                                "text": "I'm flat out. It's crazy stupid here, Kim."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "crazy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06a47373-93f7-3f65-b718-17947d8eb8f5",
                                        "entry_id": "1a1afb74-2ecd-30d8-b1a4-0cece5ac5328",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An insane or eccentric person; a crackpot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48a12d99-7491-43cb-8f24-99a3b537dcfc",
                                                "sense_id": "06a47373-93f7-3f65-b718-17947d8eb8f5",
                                                "text": "Now drink up, you knuckleheads! Have a blast! It's our night, you crazies! Chloe, where are you?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67bef9ee-f666-3ca4-bd2a-aec83660e3f1",
                                        "entry_id": "1a1afb74-2ecd-30d8-b1a4-0cece5ac5328",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eccentric behaviour; lunacy; craziness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4c60af0-771e-48ab-aaad-fc3a7d53a05c",
                                                "sense_id": "67bef9ee-f666-3ca4-bd2a-aec83660e3f1",
                                                "text": "Then again, her whole evening was full of crazy, and she didn't know what else to do."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0045b1f4-c498-4d0d-b479-c31f2ee23162",
                        "source_entry_id": "82dd56bc-476e-39a4-8636-e4c64ef5ffea",
                        "source_sense_id": "0de004b7-b79b-33f6-b9be-3051a80905df",
                        "target_lang_word": "insane",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "insane",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68b5d894-6d8b-3571-a62a-198dae0d8bbb",
                                        "entry_id": "e12e5852-6ade-3b54-9300-05cb6627bd0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exhibiting unsoundness or disorder of mind; not sane; utterly mad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b04223ef-b9ce-4efb-9bcb-e4dbceb6246b",
                                                "sense_id": "68b5d894-6d8b-3571-a62a-198dae0d8bbb",
                                                "text": "And you told me not to drive\nBut I made it home alive\nSo you said that only proves that I'm insane"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94327a85-37a8-42f6-939e-d9fb5549ef0b",
                                                "sense_id": "68b5d894-6d8b-3571-a62a-198dae0d8bbb",
                                                "text": "What is the cause of insanity? Nobody can answer such a sweeping question as that, but we know that certain diseases, such as syphilis, break down and destroy the brain cells and result in insanity. In fact, about one-half of all mental diseases can be attributed to such physical causes as brain lesions, alcohol, toxins, and injuries. But the other half—and this is the appalling part of the story—the other half of the people who go insane apparently have nothing organically wrong with their brain cells. In post-mortem examinations, when their brain tissues are studied under the highest-powered microscopes, they are found to be apparently just as healthy as yours and mine. Why do these people go insane?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e74943b7-697e-3fa5-82e9-6b1ff75a1982",
                                        "entry_id": "e12e5852-6ade-3b54-9300-05cb6627bd0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used by or relating to insane people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "177e9382-c645-4192-aa92-dfc63448cefe",
                                                "sense_id": "e74943b7-697e-3fa5-82e9-6b1ff75a1982",
                                                "text": "an insane hospital"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d326f07f-47f1-4367-a6d0-accc072adbbb",
                                                "sense_id": "e74943b7-697e-3fa5-82e9-6b1ff75a1982",
                                                "text": "an insane asylum"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8daca822-1c91-3982-b4ff-f421601b3206",
                                        "entry_id": "e12e5852-6ade-3b54-9300-05cb6627bd0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing insanity or madness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e64083a1-be49-4d74-a3ec-5ac226cef294",
                                                "sense_id": "8daca822-1c91-3982-b4ff-f421601b3206",
                                                "text": "Were such things here, as we doe speake about? / Or haue we eaten on the insane Root, / That takes the Reason Prisoner?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6dd4ec3-f700-3b99-beef-60044ff529a1",
                                        "entry_id": "e12e5852-6ade-3b54-9300-05cb6627bd0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by excess or the utmost folly; ridiculous; impractical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08c3e555-f34e-4516-9d70-cf53c7557e86",
                                                "sense_id": "e6dd4ec3-f700-3b99-beef-60044ff529a1",
                                                "text": "an insane plan"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c77085f-3d10-4606-a700-e9b054461c5b",
                                                "sense_id": "e6dd4ec3-f700-3b99-beef-60044ff529a1",
                                                "text": "an insane amount of money"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ab8db3e-5a87-4f91-8489-9bcc963afeb6",
                                                "sense_id": "e6dd4ec3-f700-3b99-beef-60044ff529a1",
                                                "text": "The preposterous altruism too![…]Resist not evil. It is an insane immolation of self—as bad intrinsically as fakirs stabbing themselves or anchorites warping their spines in caves scarcely large enough for a fair-sized dog."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b83ec4-26e7-4114-a9cc-b843b7eb5fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "e6dd4ec3-f700-3b99-beef-60044ff529a1",
                                                "text": "Yenshui is a fairly ordinary town situated between Tainan and Chiayi. However, during the Lantern Festival, on the 15th day of the first moon, the whole town goes insane."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d5b9d0b-c216-454f-8dec-d200e399a6b2",
                                                "sense_id": "e6dd4ec3-f700-3b99-beef-60044ff529a1",
                                                "text": "And what actinic, mind-wrenching form could the countermeme take? How could human hands assemble something so devastatingly powerful and hold it steady; what human mind could wield it without exploding from the inside out? What would deploying that concept in anger do to human ideatic space? How far out from the solution is modern memetic science, a year, a century? What insane impossibility has Hughes just committed himself to?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f830a332-614f-3d49-ba84-737b7732d93f",
                                        "entry_id": "e12e5852-6ade-3b54-9300-05cb6627bd0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extremely good; incredibly amazing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "288eab7f-7f9e-4a37-ad6e-c0f0a460ea39",
                                                "sense_id": "f830a332-614f-3d49-ba84-737b7732d93f",
                                                "text": "That guy is insane at FPS games."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "156adfc8-3099-4a12-8d5a-10965a619420",
                                                "sense_id": "f830a332-614f-3d49-ba84-737b7732d93f",
                                                "text": "Cederstrand was all over the ice, whipping his sled around and firing pucks into the net. It's what Straschnitzki is aiming for. \"He's insane. The turns, the shots. It's something I want to do some day.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b84c378e-0d5d-4c07-824b-9aa9f1fd4622",
                                                "sense_id": "f830a332-614f-3d49-ba84-737b7732d93f",
                                                "text": "And fans echoed their responses. \"You nailed it, girl! This movie is so special. Your work is insane! 💗,\" one person wrote. \"Is there ANYTHING you can't do?! I'm impressed,\" said another."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca1333fb-aa5d-40f1-9602-bf7da11ac11a",
                                                "sense_id": "f830a332-614f-3d49-ba84-737b7732d93f",
                                                "text": "On getting two quick eliminations, SypherPK cries out ecstatically: This gun is insane, it's the best gun ever! Woohoo!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca56b556-9bdc-3627-b6db-31677d1e0409",
                                        "entry_id": "e12e5852-6ade-3b54-9300-05cb6627bd0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Enraged; furious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4dc38bf4-25b4-4eea-9a0f-2c9f5cc4b307",
                        "source_entry_id": "82dd56bc-476e-39a4-8636-e4c64ef5ffea",
                        "source_sense_id": "0de004b7-b79b-33f6-b9be-3051a80905df",
                        "target_lang_word": "goated",
